cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the paper listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "Day-Night LiDAR Flight Comparison"
abstract: >-
  Scripts, notes, and workflow documentation for comparing drone-based LiDAR
  acquisitions collected during daytime and nighttime flights, focusing on
  signal intensity, point density, return structure, and vertical accuracy
  against GNSS validation points.
